{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>You shall not go with them.</b> Even though you shall not curse them, do not go — so that you not fix your gaze upon them for evil, as they said (Sanhedrin, chapter Ḥelek; and the last chapter of HaMokher et haSefinah): נָתַן עֵינָיו בּוֹ וְנַעֲשָׂה גַל שֶׁל עֲצָמוֹת, 'He fixed his gaze upon him and he was made a heap of bones.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:41.645073276Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}